Feature: Overdue tasks

  Let users know when tasks are overdue, even when using other
  features of the app

  Scenario Outline: eating
    Given there are <start> cucumbers
    When I eat <eat> cucumbers
    Then I should have <left> cucumbers

    Examples:
      | start | eat | left |
      |    12 |   5 |    7 |
      |    20 |   5 |   15 |
